{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "(Well then, where to go?)": "",
  "Should we go play shogi then?": "",
  "...We could do that...": "",
  "But I'm warning you right now. I'm quite the advanced player.": "",
  "Ooh, someone's competitive. I like it. Let's have a match then.": "",
  "Very well, this should be entertaining. Then let us go.": "",
  "...In the past, I knew a man who bore the sign of a needle calamity. He ended up having a terrible accident with darts.": "",
  "Will you truly be safe?": "",
  "Yeah... why wouldn't I be? It's just a cow we're after.": "",
  "All right. I'll be careful not to throw the darts anywhere near you, then.": "",
  "I imagine you'd make a good gambler, since you're a fortune teller and all.": "",
  "...Hmm. Actually, I've never tried it before.": "",
  "Then how about trying your luck? Who knows, you might have a knack for it.": "",
  "Perhaps.": "",
  "...All right, looks like we're just about done. Do you want to go relax somewhere?": "",
  "I suppose that would be wise...": "",
  "...Though I'm starting to feel like we're actually on a date.": "",
  "Is that such a bad thing? I'm thinking we might as well enjoy ourselves.": "",
  "Perhaps. But dropping your guard may just result in you getting trampled by a cow.": "",
  "Come to think of it, Amane-san, I don't really know much about you. Other than your fortune telling, I mean.": "",
  "...Are you saying that you're interested in me?": "",
  "Yeah. I'm curious what a fortune teller does in her spare time.": "",
  "Do you have any hobbies, perhaps?": "",
  "Well... I'm not entirely sure if this counts, but...": "",
  "I like small animals. Like hamsters and hedgehogs.": "",
  "Do you own one?": "",
  "Yes. I actually have a golden hamster named Yagami-san.": "",
  "Huh? What did you just say?": "",
  "I have a hamster... named Yagami-san.": "",
  "I realized it looked a lot like you, so I renamed him.": "",
  "N-No kidding...": "",
  "How would you describe a sign of calamity? I can't really imagine what that's like.": "",
  "It's as if a hazy sort of... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>image</font_kind> appears over someone's head.": "",
  "And are these images always the same?": "",
  "No, it depends on the situation. For example, it could be lashing tongues of fire, or perhaps a mirage of darkness...": "",
  "Sometimes a sign will show up very clearly, like a photograph. Whereas other times, its true form will remain clouded in a haze.": "",
  "Huh. So what does my cow calamity look like?": "",
  "...Precisely that. A cow.": "",
  "A large, fierce one, at that. Covered in sinews that swell with strength... like a matador's bull.": "",
  "Can you see it right now?": "",
  "Oh yes. Quite clearly, in fact.": "",
  "I suggest you avoid wearing red.": "",
  "Uh... Okay.": "",
  "Can you see these signs on people passing by as well?": "",
  "I can. And whenever I do, I make sure to notify that person.": "",
  "Without compensation, of course.": "",
  "Do you even make a profit from that? I mean, you gotta make a living somehow.": "",
  "...Truthfully, I gain nothing.": "",
  "But that's not an issue. I'm happy as long as my gift proves useful to others.": "",
  "Yes. All I want is to use my power to save lives, so I'm happy to do it free of charge.": "",
  "That's admirable. I don't think I could do that.": "",
  "Are you at least able to feed yourself?": "",
  "Of course. It's not like I can survive by only breathing air.": "",
  "Every now and then, I'll pick up a part-time job or two that allows me to earn a lot within a short time.": "",
  "...What kind of jobs are they?": "",
  "Mm, let's see... Nude modeling, for one.": "",
  "What!? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>That's</font_kind> the kind of work you do!?": "",
  "Yes. I was requested quite often due to my... voluptuous figure, which supposedly is very ideal for painting.": "",
  "A man can only wonder...": "",
  "My client was a young art student with too much lust for him to bear. He devoured every inch of my body with his gaze...": "",
  "I'll bet he did.": "",
  "If you ever find yourself painting, I'll be happy to model for you. It certainly won't be cheap, though.": "",
  "...Once I save up enough, sure.": "",
  "In any case...": "",
  "I inherited a mansion from my parents, so at least I have somewhere to stay. I simply lack spending money.": "",
  "I see... Well, I'm glad you have a home.": "",
  "Is your fortune telling business going well?": "",
  "Hmm... I would say...": "",
  "I'm working on it.": "",
  "(I guess it's not going too well.)": "",
  "Are you having any difficulties with your job?": "",
  "As a matter of fact, I am...": "",
  "But when I consider all of the frightening calamities swirling about the populace, my troubles seem rather trivial in comparison.": "",
  "True. But have you ever thought about yourself?": "",
  "...Pardon?": "",
  "I mean, you've paid for my services just to be able to warn people, and even got attacked in the process.": "",
  "It seems like for the amount of effort you put into helping others, you sure don't get much out of it...": "",
  "You have very a noble attitude.": "",
  "Thank you for your kind words. I knew you would understand my way of thinking.": "",
  "But that means you're choosing to suffer...": "",
  "...You're a kind person, Yagami-san.": "",
  "It's not like I'm kind to just anyone. Only you.": "",
  "*chuckle* Well, I'm certainly pleased to hear that.": "",
  "...I had no idea you were such a flirtatious man.": "",
  "Hahaha. I was only kidding.": "",
  "Were you really?": "",
  "If you're comfortable enough, would you tell me what's on your mind?": "",
  "My customers...": "",
  "What about them?": "",
  "They always get scared of me and run away. It happens whenever I warn them about their calamities.": "",
  "Wait, that's what's been bothering you?": "",
  "It has indeed.": "",
  "I offer them advice so that they can avoid imminent peril, and yet they flee as if I were something hideous.": "",
  "What's worse is that most people run away before I can even get the words out.": "",
  "What could I be doing wrong?": "",
  "Well, how do you approach these people?": "",
  "...Hmm...": "",
  "I could always explain, but perhaps it would be quicker to show you.": "",
  "You sir, over there. Do you have a moment?": "",
  "Whoa... just like that, huh?": "",
  "Huh? Are you talking to me?": "",
  "How unfortunate... I detect a great calamity in your future.": "",
  "An academic disaster is about to befall you... Yes... I can see that studying will bring you great misfortune.": "",
  "What... are you talking about?": "",
  "Be sure to guard your material possessions as you fill your mind with knowledge, lest you slip and lose both to the void.": "",
  "Lady, what the hell are you talking about!? What is this nonsense all of a sudden?": "",
  "My exams are coming up tomorrow, so stop bogging me down with all your cryptic negativity!": "",
  "H-Hold on, Amane-san!": "",
  "Let's get back to our seats for now.": "",
  "Sorry about that, man.": "",
  "So, I got a grasp of how you usually are with people. There's definitely an issue here.": "",
  "Was there something amiss about my approach?": "",
  "Yeah. You see, anyone would get scared if you told them they're gonna suffer right off the bat.": "",
  "Is there any way you can make your warnings sound less extreme? Without, like, unloading the doom and gloom?": "",
  "Less... extreme, you say?": "",
  "Yeah. Your tone, for example. Maybe try approaching them in a more friendly way. These are random strangers we're talking about here.": "",
  "Well, I know it's tough because you don't exactly know what the calamity is. But on the other hand, no one has any real reason to believe you.": "",
  "And with your approach just now, it almost sounded like you were threatening that guy with impending doom.": "",
  "That isn't my intention... although it is the truth.": "",
  "In that case, I suggest you try to make it sound a little less... frightening.": "",
  "You're right. I'll be mindful of that next time.": "",
  "Do you always approach people like that?": "",
  "...Yes. I assumed it would be best to tell people the truth directly...": "",
  "But I suppose that's been scaring them away.": "",
  "Well, you can never be too careful.": "",
  "How about we take a picture together? Something to remember this by.": "",
  "You know, I think I'd like that.": "",
  "Yep. Looks good to me.": "",
  "Would you mind sending that to me later?": "",
  "Mmm, could be better. Let's do this one over.": "",
  "Yagami-san, look. It's that student from earlier.": "",
  "A calamity of studying will surely attack that young man. Should we not watch over him? Or at least deliver a proper warning?": "",
  "Are you absolutely sure something bad's gonna happen to him?": "",
  "Fate does not bear false witness, Yagami-san. There is no doubt in my mind.": "",
  "All right. Then I'll go with you.": "",
  "Hmm... Still sounds kinda fishy to me...": "",
  "If you're not going to accompany me, then I'll go by myself.": "",
  "Hm? What's this other guy doing...?": "",
  "...A purse-snatcher?": "",
  "Hey. That bag you're holding. It's not yours, is it?": "",
  "...Ack!": "",
  "If you return it without raising an issue, I might just let you off the hook without getting the police involved.": "",
  "...I-I'm sorry! It honestly happened on a whim!": "",
  "I'll give it back right now, so please don't call the cops!": "",
  "Thank you so much for getting back my precious bag!": "",
  "Looks like you got so focused on studying, you didn't even notice it was gone.": "",
  "Seriously! I almost got screwed... The admission form for my upcoming exam's inside there!": "",
  "(Amane-san was spot-on yet again...)": "",
  "Thank you for believing in me, Yagami-san.": "",
  "This is the fourth time, after all... I'd be stupid if I didn't recognize your powers by now.": "",
  "...Indeed.": "",
  "Well, we are partners. I guess we've come a long way together.": "",
  "Indeed. And I will admit it's reassuring to have you here with me.": "",
  "It seems as though you have the power to resolve calamities whereas I have the power to predict them.": "",
  "Perhaps this could make for quite an interesting relationship...": "",
  "I'm glad you think so.": "",
  "Yagami-san. Thank you for tagging along with me today.": "",
  "The time we spent together was quite enjoyable.": "",
  "Oh? Does that mean your objective changed? I thought you were watching over my calamity.": "",
  "Ah. You're right.": "",
  "I had so much fun that I completely forgot.": "",
  "Heh. I'm glad you had a good time.": "",
  "Well then, let us meet again soon... unless a calamity befalls you.": "",
  "Did you have to end it on an ominous note?": "",
  "Haha, don't be such a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>cow</font_kind>-ard.": "",
  "It would seem that the cow calamity decided not to manifest today.": "",
  "In fact, it's as if... it's <font_kind=yakuza_italic>moo</font_kind>-ving away from you...": "",
  "Maybe you just need the right <font_kind=yakuza_italic>cattle</font_kind>-yst...": "",
  "(She's really milking those cow puns for all they're worth... I'm gonna have to keep up somehow.)": "",
  "Goodbye then...": "",
  "Hey, Amane-san. Is the cow calamity still there?": "",
  "Yes. I saw it clearly from far away. And it's getting even bigger.": "",
  "Mm. Your misfortune appears to be concatenating with that of something else...": "",
  "It is as if the very threads of fate are entangling you into a snare, leaving you utterly powerless to run away from ruin.": "",
  "That's... pretty dark.": "",
  "Then I'll just have to find that evil cow and defeat it as soon as possible.": "",
  "That certainly would be prudent.": "",
  "Perhaps we should engage in a game of sport or merriment... Not for our own sake, but to lure out this disastrous bovine.": "",
  "(All right. Where should we go this time...)": "",
  "This should be entertaining. Come, let's go.": "",
  "Should we go play shogi again?": "",
  "Good idea. Time for a serious game.": "",
  "How about we kill some time for a bit? Want to play darts?": "",
  "Yeah... why wouldn't I be? It's just a cow we're after. ": "",
  "I get the feeling you'd be good at gambling, since you're a fortune teller and all.": "",
  "Should we check out the casino?": "",
  "Certainly. I think I've made some gains in the gambling realm.": "",
  "I am a fortune teller, after all.": "",
  "It would seem our oxen opponent has failed to show itself yet again.": "",
  "If it's going to show up at all, I'd rather have it happen sooner than later...": "",
  "Wait a sec... Beef Zone?": "",
  "...Yagami-san. Do my eyes deceive me, or is that...?": "",
  "Yeah... That's definitely a cow.": "",
  "Right now, this restaurant is quite possibly the most dangerous place in the world to you.": "",
  "Even the smallest bite of beef will wrack your organs with writhing pain and poison! Of this I am certain!": "",
  "...You wanna check it out?": "",
  "What!? Surely you jest!": "",
  "Nah, my friend Kim-san runs that place. I know he wouldn't serve us anything but the best.": "",
  "Besides, it has something to do with cows. I think it's the perfect place to lure out that calamity.": "",
  "But you would be plunging into chaos itself.": "",
  "Ah, I'll be fine. Let's just head in and enjoy. My treat.": "",
  "You've... lost your mind...": "",
  "Ohh, how horrendous! The entire place reeks with the tainted stench of animal flesh!": "",
  "Don't say that kind of stuff inside a restaurant...": "",
  "Welcome to the Beef Zone! ...Oh? Yagami-san?": "",
  "Hey, Kim-san. You got seats for two?": "",
  "For you folks? You bet I do.": "",
  "And who's this beautiful young lady? I didn't know you had a girlfriend!": "",
  "I... beg your pardon?": "",
  "Oh, was I mistaken?": "",
  "Nope, she's my girlfriend. Cute, isn't she?": "",
  "W-Wait just a moment! Yagami-san, what is the meaning of this!?": "",
  "Well I'd appreciate it if you didn't toy with my feelings like that!": "",
  "Sounds like you two have some issues to work out.": "",
  "She's just a friend, Kim-san.": "",
  "Oh, okay. Sorry to confuse things.": "",
  "Anyway, feel free to have a seat wherever you like!": "",
  "Perhaps you should take the path of caution and stick to only vegetables?": "",
  "No way. I'm not gonna put myself on a diet because of some stupid calamity.": "",
  "Well, time to dig in!": "",
  "Mmm. Now that's good beef!": "",
  "Please be careful...": "",
  "(All right. Now what should we talk about...)": "",
  "Tell me more about yourself, Amane-san.": "",
  "Sure. What would you like to know?": "",
  "Come to think about it, I don't even know your full name.": "",
  "...That's right. I haven't revealed that to you yet.": "",
  "It's... Tsumugi.": "",
  "Ah, so your full name is Amane Tsumugi?": "",
  "The opposite, actually.": "",
  "Yes. My name is Tsumugi Amane.": "",
  "Whoa. That sounds even more intense.": "",
  "Does it? I thought it strange to introduce myself to strangers by my first name.": "",
  "I guess that makes sense.": "",
  "Yagami-san, what's your first name?": "",
  "Takayuki.": "",
  "Takayuki-san... Such a gentle name. I think it fits you quite well.": "",
  "So does yours.": "",
  "How old are you, Amane-san?": "",
  "My, such a direct question.": "",
  "The answer lies not within your reach.": "",
  "Aww man.": "",
  "How old are <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind>, Yagami-san?": "",
  "I'm thirty-five. Inching ever closer to my forties.": "",
  "Thirty-five. Wow, you don't look like it.": "",
  "So, what about you?": "",
  "...If you're that curious, then why don't you try and guess?": "",
  "Okay, if that's how you want to play.": "",
  "That would be correct.": "",
  "Okay, now I just have to guess the number...": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
